  "schematicNotes": [
    {
      "id": "n_can",
      "width": 390,
      "text": "CAN BUS harness. 1 Mbit/s ISO 11898-2. Only the CAN-Lambda crosses the firewall, on bulkhead B c13 / c14 (CAN) and c3 / c4 (+12V / GND); the cluster and RealDash are CAN drops only - their devices and their power are not part of this harness. 120R termination at the ECU end and at the lambda end.",
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 2700,
        "y": 240
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n_cavity_notes",
      "text": "CAVITY NOTES - full text of the signals marked * on this drawing\nLink CAN-Lambda c1: Power +12V ign, LOGIC LAM 7.5A - broken off here, continues on ST185-B-engine, bulkhead B c3, ST185-B-cabin, from ST185-CabinPower fuse LOGIC LAM\nt_cluster_can: TrackCluster ESP32-P4 - CAN drop (device not in this harness)\nt_realdash_can: RealDash Pi 5 - CAN drop (device not in this harness)\nsp_shield_can (Splice): CAN drain T-splice at the bus branch point (Daniel 2026-10-12). The trunk drain w_shd_can runs on (broken off) to ST185-B-cabin and is T-spliced there onto the B17 drain; each node branch drain (ECU port, CSB3, cluster, RealDash, bulkhead / Lambda) is soldered onto the trunk drain here where 6 mm of its insulation is cut away. Drains stay 20 AWG - no combined-gauge pigtail.",
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 2820,
        "y": 420
      },
      "width": 390
    },
    {
      "id": "n_can_two_runs",
      "width": 390,
      "text": "TWO RUNS, NO SHARED LEG (N28, DECISIONS R179). This harness is built as two separate runs. Cabin run: ECU COMMS port (centre dash) - CSB3 plug pins 5 / 6 (under the centre cluster) - cluster and Pi CAN drops - bulkhead DRB102 pins 92 / 93 / 94, cabin side (RH firewall, plugs into ST185-B-cabin). Engine run: bulkhead DRB102 pins 92 / 93 / 94, engine side (RH firewall, from ST185-B-engine) - Link CAN-Lambda (120R end). The two runs meet only through bulkhead B (DRB102 pins 92 / 93 CAN H / L, 94 screen); no wire joins them inside this harness, so there is no bundle between them.",
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 2700,
        "y": -360
      }
    }
  ],
